      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki tablo, se\u00e7ili KIO'nun son isteklerine ait trace'leri listeler (Trace ID, s\u00fcre, k\u00f6k span). Bir sat\u0131rdaki **Trace ID** de\u011ferini kopyalay\u0131p yukar\u0131daki **Trace ID** kutusuna yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n \u2014 alt\u0131ndaki panel o i\u015flemin ad\u0131m ad\u0131m s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 (repo_scan \u2192 prepare_prompt \u2192 llm_call \u2192 postprocess) \u015felale g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm\u00fcyle g\u00f6sterir. Panel bo\u015f kal\u0131rsa ayn\u0131 Trace ID ile Explore \u2192 Tempo \u00fczerinden de a\u00e7\u0131labilir."
